Z||000000||Bob Englert||03-07-2001||10:26 PM||||Just a reminder for any NC or nearby Fiero owners that want to get together in Hickory this Saturday for lunch and Fiero talk....<P>We are meeting at 1:00PM at the Golden Corral steakhouse just off I-40 at exit 125.  <P>If anyone from eastern NC is interested in driving over together we will meet at the McDonalds in Kernersville, NC at I-40 exit 203 at 11:00AM or so.  It should be about 1 hour and 15 min to Hickory from Kernersville.<P>Hopefully the weather will be good.  I hope to see many of you on Saturday.<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
